by_id['1987-739.3']['statement']=r'Let k be an algebraically closed field and Q a finite acyclic quiver. Describe bounded t-structures on \(D^b(\operatorname{rep}_kQ)\) whose heart \(\mathcal A\) is a finite-length abelian k-category with a projective generator and finite-dimensional Hom spaces, and whose realization functor \(D^b(\mathcal A)\to D^b(\operatorname{rep}_kQ)\) is an equivalence.'
by_id['1987-739.3']['fate']=r'\citet[Theorems~3.3, 7.1 and~8.5]{parthasarathy1988tstructures} gives a criterion for the specified t-structure data, the relation to iterated tilted algebras, and completeness in the Dynkin case. The manuscript was received 15 February 1988, revised 13 May, and published in December 1988 by Parthasarathy, whose work Kapranov reports here. Receipt proves manuscript existence, not public pre-talk circulation; no earlier exact public source for these combined results was established. The notebook blanket sentence is broader than these theorems.'
by_id['1987-739.5']['fate']=by_id['1987-739.5']['fate'].replace('``only','only')
save()

